  "label": "User projected onto the UglyDolls characters as embodying 'ugly' and lacking choice",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the UglyDolls characters, who are visually depicted as 'ugly' and are the subject of the text 'when you are that ugly you don't have a choice'. This projection implies the user identifies with the characters' condition of being 'ugly' and feeling powerless or without agency due to their appearance. The meme uses the characters as a stand-in for the user's own perceived ugliness and the resulting lack of choice in life.",
